nre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Greetings again! I really loved the artwork you did for me in the past, and I was hoping you would lend your talents again!\n\nThis is for another FFXIV character, who gives off a distinguished, formal personality. He is a Naval officer of sorts, recently promoted in spite of facing many difficulties. Though he manages to keep a professional disposition at most times, he can have an explosive temper when provoked, and harbors deep shame about crimes of his past.\n\nIn this commission, I would like him to embody the mood of a classical Navy officer portrait of the 19th century. I have included some references here for poses and mood: https://imgur.com/a/yX1kHO9\n\nThank you very much for your amazing work, once again!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/tr9oRv8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TKmatsu_281/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/aec69854/uploads/origins/ed65ec0e-a0b0-43af-9f7d-b7891ac9145a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6da29ebfc6b094cf7555fe73e739c292", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aec69854/uploads/origins/ed65ec0e-a0b0-43af-9f7d-b7891ac9145a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6da29ebfc6b094cf7555fe73e739c292, https://si.imgix.net/aec69854/uploads/origins/ed65ec0e-a0b0-43af-9f7d-b7891ac9145a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=786942169e6ca337dc8f0b50ca27ed09 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aec69854/uploads/origins/ed65ec0e-a0b0-43af-9f7d-b7891ac9145a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03edf19c8f34ffbee7ce5d0858f50d13 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。私はあなたが男性をデザインする方法が好きで、あなたから写真をもらいたいと思っています。\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/MtlrN7K.png\n\nこれは私が昔遊んだゲームのキャラクターですが、彼をハーフドラゴンの男性としてリデザインしていただきたいと思います。  彼の名前はマルドゥック・ネブカド、凶暴で力強く、友人には優しいことで知られる大人です。\n\n服装は自由ですが、スタイリッシュでモダンなものにしてください。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"pa